    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're an ai but i'm just trying to figure out if i need to rush to the er right now. the pain is intense but i've dealt with this before and it usually just passes after some ibuprofen. like, if i just double up on the ibuprofen and drink a ton of water, do u think that would help clear the stone? i'm just worried about the hospital bill if it's just another stone.",
