    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but i really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to. the pulsing thing is probably just my heart beating faster because of the pain. if i take some extra tylenol and just lie on my heating pad for an hour to see if it settles down, would that be okay? i just really need to know if i can wait it out a bit.",
